  "limits": [
    "Each case assumes an older poll task already exists; its HTTP response is synthetic and the network call is represented when publication is injected.",
    "The worker runs through its real 200-tick cooldown call, then pauses with saved registers before free/handle-clear; cleanup resumes after synthetic main delays reach the due tick. No RTOS scheduling or real time is executed.",
    "Main starts after successful storage/task admission and stops before deadline selection/shutdown. Logging, network, connectivity, image and scheduling helpers are stubbed.",
    "The completion semaphore give is modeled successful; no real semaphore contention, socket disconnect, physical image loss or frequency is established.",
    "No device, backend, network or HA change was made."
  ]
